  "research_interests": [
    " My broader area of research is to work on the existence of primitive pair, the existence of r-primitive k-normal pair and the existence of a finite arithmetic progression of r-primitive elements with first term being k-normal, with prescribed traces and norms over finite fields. Further, numerical calculations are carried in SageMath to provide some illustrations."
],

